Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.63,0:00:16.79,Song,,0,0,0,,Me wo aketa kikkake wa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.79,0:00:21.79,Song,,0,0,0,,Kokoro saku joukei
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:24.79,Song,,0,0,0,,Hirari hirari yubi no sukima kara
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.79,0:00:27.42,Song,,0,0,0,,Mietekuru shinjitsu wo nirame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:32.38,Song,,0,0,0,,Kizukareta no wa, rakuen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.38,0:00:36.17,Song,,0,0,0,,Massakasama ochite
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.17,0:00:40.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Aa tatoe kouya demo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:47.33,Song,,0,0,0,,Hitori de ikiru to oritachimashou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:48.50,Song,,0,0,0,,Ikanakucha
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:00:52.13,Song,,0,0,0,,Koko ni aru hana wa ima eien nare to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.13,0:00:58.54,Song,,0,0,0,,Gokujou no chihedo wo haite watashi ga ueta mono
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:04.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Kono koe de ashi de te de watashi no mama mogaku hodo ni
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:10.13,Song,,0,0,0,,Doushiyou mo nai sekai ga itoshii
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.50,0:01:17.17,Song,,0,0,0,,Tadoritsuku wa kanarazu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.17,0:01:23.17,Song,,0,0,0,,Musekaeru hodo no yume
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:33.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You passed the enrollment exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.54,0:01:35.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on getting accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.71,0:01:37.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm... I'm going to work hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.92,0:01:40.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and become a great spy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.63,0:01:42.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Make sure that you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.75,0:01:44.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're expecting great things out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.29,0:01:45.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.79,0:01:52.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She was so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.25,0:01:55.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't think we've accepted a student that young
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.25,0:01:57.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,since Flower Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:03.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That jazz selection brings us right into our news from the States.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.88,0:02:05.38,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,It's been half a year.\N{\rSubtitle-4}That jazz selection brings us right into our news from the States.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.38,0:02:09.33,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I doubt a washout like her could have survived that long.\N{\rSubtitle-4}That jazz selection brings us right into our news from the States.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.33,0:02:12.00,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,For the last few days, the Mitario tabloids have been abuzz
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:13.63,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,with speculation about their local villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.21,0:02:18.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,They call her Lillian the Devil,\Nbut her real name is Lillian Hepburn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.21,0:02:21.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,She's been connected to seventy-six suspicious deaths
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.33,0:02:23.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,and was shot to death after a standoff with the police,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.42,0:02:25.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lillian, you're the talk of the town.\N{\rSubtitle-4}but the shocking part is that by day,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.71,0:02:27.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks for noticing, Sybilla!\N{\rSubtitle-4}she worked as a normal waitress{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.67,0:02:29.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,at Westport Building's ground floor burger joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.96,0:02:32.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At long last, my era's finally arrived!\N{\rSubtitle-4}Mysteries abound about who this woman really was,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.83,0:02:34.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,and as speculation continues flying,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.67,0:02:37.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see you've decided to accept the inevitable.\N{\rSubtitle-4}some articles have even gone so far as to theorize{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.79,0:02:40.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Check out the mugshot.\N{\rSubtitle-4}that Lillian is secretly still alive...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.17,0:02:41.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,that Lillian is secretly still alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.92,0:02:43.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That doesn't look anything like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.83,0:02:45.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a misdirection tactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.83,0:02:50.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach and the United States's intelligence agency\Nintentionally spread it as misinformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.33,0:02:53.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think it's cool how sinister she looks, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.79,0:02:55.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.21,0:03:00.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When my story gets made into a movie,\NI bet they'll get a big-name actress to play me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:06.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'd think I'd be used to it by now,\Nbut shit just rolls off her back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.29,0:03:07.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:09.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's one of her most admirable qualities.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.33,0:03:14.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She seems fine, but it's the other\Nabsentee I'm worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.21,0:03:18.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen her leave her room in days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.42,0:03:23.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is she still asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.13,0:03:25.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:27.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thea!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:28.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.67,0:03:29.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.96,0:03:31.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.21,0:03:32.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:35.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Thea, you'll never guess what they were\Njust saying on the radio about-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:37.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thea?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:39.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.71,0:03:50.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't really blame her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:53.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She went through a lot in Mitario.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.13,0:03:56.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I have anything with\Nan aroma that would help her relax...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.54,0:03:59.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.42,0:04:02.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Klaus loves you."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:13.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Klaus covets you"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.42,0:04:16.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, that isn't it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.25,0:04:21.17,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,After I found that key,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.17,0:04:24.71,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I started looking for the keyhole it went with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.33,0:04:26.54,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Eventually...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.67,0:04:27.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.88,0:04:35.08,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hearth...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.75,0:04:38.17,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,When you passed away six months ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.17,0:04:41.92,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,you predicted that Teach would bring me to Mitario.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.04,0:04:44.83,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Inferno had fallen,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.83,0:04:48.96,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,so with his teammates gone,\NTeach was bound to build a new team.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:50.46,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,That much makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.46,0:04:54.38,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,You could definitely have predicted as much\Nback when you were still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:59.25,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,But how could you have known that\NI was one of the people he would recruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.79,0:05:03.79,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that filling in this blank\Nwill help me understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.25,0:05:05.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeeeeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:10.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach is in love with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:12.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.92,0:05:14.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Unless... Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:17.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Back in Mitario...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:40.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're out of tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.33,0:05:49.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.83,0:05:52.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was magnificent, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.63,0:06:03.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You fought well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.92,0:06:05.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and rest for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:09.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thinking back now, that was\Ntotally a bridal carry he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.13,0:06:12.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could Teach actually be in love with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.63,0:06:16.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Big Sis Lily?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.04,0:06:17.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:19.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-nothing!\NNothing happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:21.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I smell something interesting afoot, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:22.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.83,0:06:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's this?\NLooks shifty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.67,0:06:28.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't look at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:31.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, long story short!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.83,0:06:33.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.75,0:06:35.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'll understand everything once you read it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.25,0:06:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Klaus..."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:40.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"...loves you"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:42.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who was this meant for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.83,0:06:44.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:48.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we're the ones Lily gave it to, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.46,0:06:51.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.67,0:06:53.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, Teach is in love with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.88,0:06:57.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure it's just some nasty misinformation, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:06:59.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeeeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:12.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I should really get this room fixed already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.96,0:07:16.17,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.17,0:07:19.75,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Should I just bite the bullet and ask Teach directly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.50,0:07:29.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.75,0:07:32.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeeeeeeeeeeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.63,0:07:37.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Annette, Lily and Erna are acting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.79,0:07:39.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have any idea what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.42,0:07:42.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got the cause right here, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.25,0:07:44.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is for you, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.50,0:07:47.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.50,0:07:50.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once you read it, you'll understand everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.88,0:07:54.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What even is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.08,0:07:55.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it addressed to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:02.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.75,0:08:06.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What should we make for dinner tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.25,0:08:07.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How's hamburgers sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.63,0:08:09.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That radio report got me thinkin' about 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:11.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, that's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:23.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyone up for a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.54,0:08:24.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:26.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not feelin' it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.42,0:08:27.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.17,0:08:31.71,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Could Teach...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.71,0:08:33.50,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,...really feel that way about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.50,0:08:35.58,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,What do I do? How the hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.58,0:08:37.33,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,...am I supposed to break this to the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.29,0:08:49.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just bought up a gazillion cakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's make some tea,\Nand I'll explain while we're eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.54,0:08:56.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got something really important to tell you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.50,0:08:57.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What kinda somethin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:08:59.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A big something!\NAbout Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.79,0:09:03.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, there you all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.58,0:09:05.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have something I wanted to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.71,0:09:08.71,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,N-no way, Teach, you wouldn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.71,0:09:12.42,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,You're not about to ask me out\Nin front of everyone, are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.38,0:09:22.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Some contractors are going to be arriving\Nthis evening to fix up Lily's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:24.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These are special spy repairmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I imagine this won't be the last time\Nwe need their services,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:30.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I was wondering if one of you\Nwould join me in welcoming them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.13,0:09:33.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,J-just one of us?!\NAlone with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.54,0:09:36.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, there's no need for all of you to\Nexpose your faces to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.96,0:09:39.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're the leader, Lily,\Nso you're in charge of figuring it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.79,0:09:41.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-who, me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:43.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, you. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:48.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What was going on there?\NAll of them were acting strangely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.58,0:09:51.67,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,T-Teach, do you hear what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:55.46,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,That would make it our very first\Nl-lovey-dovey joint op!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.46,0:09:57.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, where're Grete and Thea?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:10:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know.\NI think they took off for somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:02.33,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Th-that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.33,0:10:05.54,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,It's not like I actually want to start dating Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.54,0:10:09.00,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,If anything, I'd much rather help Grete\Nhave her love come to fruition!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:14.83,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,And plus, I'm also Lamplight's leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.17,0:10:18.67,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I need to put this whole situation to rest\Nbefore Grete gets back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.00,0:10:20.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.21,0:10:22.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can I ask everyone's advice about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.21,0:10:25.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Advice? What kinda advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:26.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-it's about love!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.75,0:10:31.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to go tell Teach about how\NI really feel about him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.38,0:10:34.38,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.38,0:10:36.17,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I need to make sure he knows I'm not interested!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.17,0:10:37.50,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I need to protect Grete.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.50,0:10:40.29,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I need to protect our team unity!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:43.42,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,That's a bad call, Lily.\NYou're gonna get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.83,0:10:45.79,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm the one...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.79,0:10:47.13,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I'm the one...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.13,0:10:48.33,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I'm the one...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.54,0:10:51.25,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,...he's really in love with!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:54.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.83,0:10:58.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was afraid that you were trying\Nto seduce the boss in earnest, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.21,0:10:59.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.25,0:11:03.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So? Where is it we're going, Grete?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.00,0:11:04.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's someone I want you to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.83,0:11:08.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That note of yours is quite the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:13.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I suspect we'll need more information\Nif we want to solve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.75,0:11:19.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a woman who might have some answers\Nabout the boss and Inferno.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.29,0:11:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Grete, is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:25.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.54,0:11:37.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on being released,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.17,0:11:41.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What're you doing here, you crazy bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:44.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have something I wanted to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.13,0:11:46.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I need information about my boss's past.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.42,0:11:50.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you be so kind as to tell me the intelligence\Nthat got leaked to the Galgad Empire?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.75,0:11:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And why would I do that?\NI see no reason to tell you a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.17,0:12:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Roland passed away over in Mitario.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:07.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That button is from the shirt he was wearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.79,0:12:09.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the only memento he left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.33,0:12:32.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tell me one thing, Bonfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:38.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you think I ever could have become your rival?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.83,0:12:40.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not in a million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.50,0:12:43.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.21,0:12:45.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you expect me to console you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.67,0:12:49.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're going to die without having achieved\Na single one of your goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.33,0:12:53.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Considering how many innocent lives you've taken,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.92,0:12:55.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it's a fitting way for you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.67,0:12:56.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.92,0:13:03.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I would say you've earned yourself the right\Nto have us give you a proper sendoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.17,0:13:07.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.58,0:13:11.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It only lasted for a single moment,\Nand maybe it was all just a sick joke,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.38,0:13:16.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but it was kind of nice getting to\Nfight by your side back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:21.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thea, thank you for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.54,0:13:24.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Roland...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:38.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You wanted information about Bonfire, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.63,0:13:41.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, there's not much I actually know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.83,0:13:47.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All Roland told me was to avoid\Nfighting him no matter what,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.21,0:13:49.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and to call for help the moment I ran into him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:52.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That, and he gave me a photo and a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.71,0:13:53.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.13,0:13:55.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,May I ask what that name was?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.71,0:13:57.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There were a couple he told me:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.46,0:13:59.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bonfire... The Dust King...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.38,0:14:02.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ax... Lone... Practical...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.71,0:14:05.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That and Crowbar were all of them, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.75,0:14:07.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's all I can really tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.08,0:14:09.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's enough chatting.\NLet's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:17.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Olivia only has at most half a year left to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.58,0:14:24.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Before they release her at the airport,\Nthey're going to secretly dose her with a drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.08,0:14:29.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shortly after she arrives back in her homeland,\Nher mind will start to become muddled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:33.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She'll spread all sorts of incomprehensible\Ngibberish before ultimately perishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.58,0:14:35.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Does she know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.25,0:14:39.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine they would tell her\Nsomething like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:44.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This time it really is goodbye, Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:52.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's something I realized after\Nhearing Olivia's description.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.08,0:14:55.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One of the names she listed was Crowbar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.83,0:14:59.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You must have already met the boss seven years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.88,0:15:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,During the rescue, he was the one who\Nkilled your kidnappers with a crowbar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.50,0:15:09.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But he's never shown me the slightest sign\Nthat that's the case!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.71,0:15:16.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You figured something out, didn't you, Grete?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.21,0:15:20.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, just give it to me straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:24.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, that must have been\NMs. Hearth wanted me to realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.21,0:15:27.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.08,0:15:30.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hearth took care of you on her own\Nafter the rescue, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.54,0:15:31.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.75,0:15:35.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And all of the dead kidnappers were male, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.71,0:15:36.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.92,0:15:39.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A group of men captured and locked me up-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.17,0:15:43.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.67,0:15:46.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How could I not remember something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.25,0:15:49.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The trauma likely made your memories fuzzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.21,0:15:55.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Young as he was at the time, the boss was still male,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.54,0:15:57.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so Hearth must have made him leave the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.88,0:16:01.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It makes sense why he never told you what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.83,0:16:05.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.25,0:16:10.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,People assume that assault victims like you\Nwill develop androphobia...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.67,0:16:17.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...but there are cases of people who abandon their\Ninhibitions in order to overwrite their trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:21.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hearth guided me down the\Npath to becoming a spy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.92,0:16:24.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,in order to help me avoid developing a sex addiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.00,0:16:26.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what you're saying, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.42,0:16:27.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.42,0:16:30.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And the boss knew that that was her plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.00,0:16:34.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so seven years later when he was putting together\NLamplight, he chose you for the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.08,0:16:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's how Ms. Hearth was able to predict\Nthat I would end up in Mitario.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.38,0:16:43.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She knew that Teach's connection to me\Nwould lead him to bring me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.88,0:16:47.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That belief inspired her to spread the rumor\Nabout the black-haired hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:50.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, that's the full truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.17,0:16:53.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Klaus saved you."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.50,0:16:56.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what the message was telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.42,0:16:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She wanted to help me face my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.42,0:17:01.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thea...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.83,0:17:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hearth...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.04,0:17:06.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have talked with you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.92,0:17:09.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Grete...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:13.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, it feels like life has\Ntoo many downs and not enough ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.46,0:17:15.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It does, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.42,0:17:18.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:26.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What even HAPPENED here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.50,0:17:29.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I finally caught her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:31.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I filmed the whole thing, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.75,0:17:35.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was just as funny as I hoped it would be.\NMaybe funnier!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.25,0:17:43.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At the time, I felt like I had to keep\NLily from asking Teach out,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.13,0:17:45.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,even if that meant stopping her by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.46,0:17:47.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, same, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:53.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...I didn't want to see Big Sis Lily ask Teach out\Nonly to end up with her feelings hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.46,0:17:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-what are you three talking about?\NThat doesn't make sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.88,0:18:00.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you know that I'm the one Teach is in love with?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:08.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It all started 'cuz of this, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.17,0:18:10.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.63,0:18:13.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the note I wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.08,0:18:14.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I must have dropped it somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.88,0:18:18.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Say WHAT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.13,0:18:20.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, that bit about Teach being in love with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.67,0:18:22.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Was a misunderstanding.\NAll of it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.17,0:18:25.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who was the first one to pick it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:27.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I would say that they're the main culprit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.54,0:18:33.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I was acting in my capacity as team leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.54,0:18:35.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was trying to protect the team!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.54,0:18:42.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:45.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was feeling down, but you cheered me right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.58,0:18:49.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd like to thank you too, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.79,0:18:52.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't go hogging all\Nthe catharsis for yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.63,0:18:54.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I demand satisfaction!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.00,0:18:57.75,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,\Nshe mentioned this a lot back when she was still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.25,0:19:03.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No matter how awash in pain the world gets,\Nnever let it break you, Klaus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.08,0:19:08.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mustn't forget to put smiles on people's faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.42,0:19:12.75,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Thank you for reminding me of that, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.50,0:19:19.00,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I can see that I made the right call\Nback when I appointed you as team leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.71,0:19:22.58,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're doing all right for yourself,\NFlower Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.75,0:19:24.67,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Back when I heard that a washout like you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.67,0:19:28.00,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,would be joining a team that\Nspecialized in Impossible Missions,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:30.83,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I figured it would be, well, impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.33,0:19:34.33,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,But clearly, I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.33,0:19:37.00,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,You've found a place where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:39.75,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,A flower garden where you can bloom freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.92,0:19:42.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stop laughing at me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.29,0:19:43.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In case you forgot, I'm your leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.96,0:19:45.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm about to get mad here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.46,0:19:47.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be angrier than angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.79,0:21:25.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The repairs are all finished,\Nso there's something I wanted to tell you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.42,0:21:30.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's about what I mentioned before we left for Mitario.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.46,0:21:33.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How if you completed the mission,\Nyou would all graduate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.42,0:21:35.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.63,0:21:37.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You completed the mission with flying colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.25,0:21:39.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Consider yourselves graduates.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:40.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.67,0:21:42.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's a question from all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.21,0:21:45.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't the logical thing be\Nto take the repaired room,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.17,0:21:47.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the one that used to belong to Hearth,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.08,0:21:50.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and have you inherit it, Teach?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:51.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.50,0:21:53.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I concur.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.54,0:21:54.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.67,0:21:55.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ditto.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.67,0:21:57.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M-me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.54,0:21:58.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.75,0:22:01.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I agree with the others, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.13,0:22:05.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you say, Boss?\NWe all feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.25,0:22:06.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I say, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.50,0:22:08.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And don't call me Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.67,0:22:09.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That doesn't seem right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.96,0:22:13.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By this point, you're well and truly our boss, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.46,0:22:17.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, what's the harm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.71,0:22:21.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're all graduatin',\Nso you should go ahead and graduate, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.25,0:22:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Move on from that wishy-washy position of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.58,0:22:26.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, you're saying we need to bring\Nthe team to its next stage?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.67,0:22:29.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We do have the Serpent situation to consider.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.08,0:22:35.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Roland!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.38,0:22:36.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Screw off, you freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.79,0:22:40.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you seriously captured Purple Ant alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.33,0:22:48.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're really making a nuisance of yourself, Bonfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.13,0:22:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For Serpent, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.50,0:22:52.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you people trying to achieve?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.92,0:22:55.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're not just some random team\Nof Imperial loyalists.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.21,0:22:57.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What makes you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.75,0:23:01.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My mentor never would have joined you if you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.50,0:23:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, if I had to put it into words...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.54,0:23:05.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we're trying to balance the scales.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.17,0:23:08.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.92,0:23:10.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am Lamplight's boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.13,0:23:14.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And to me, you all are...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.67,0:23:18.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No matter what Serpent's goal is,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.67,0:23:22.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it's certain to be something that will\Nshake the world to its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.92,0:23:26.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's up to us, Lamplight, to stop them.
